    <us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-1825">Subsequent Event&lt;div style="text-indent:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;In January 2026, we recognized approximately $32.0&#160;billion of unrealized gains in our non-marketable investments. These unrealized gains reflect an estimated increase in the fair value measurement following observable transactions that occurred in January 2026, and are subject to change as we finalize related valuations. See Note 3 and Note 7 for further details on equity investments and OI&amp;amp;E.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock>
    <goog:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueFVNIUnrealizedGainLoss contextRef="c-431" decimals="-8" id="f-1826" unitRef="usd">32000000000</goog:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueFVNIUnrealizedGainLoss>
